OL,3,AThousands of veterans march past
OL,4,ACenotaph on Remembrance Sunday after
OL,5,AKing leads two-minute silence
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 10,000 armed forces veterans are
OL,8,Fmarching down Whitehall to mark
OL,9,FRemembrance Sunday
OL,11,FEarlier, the King led the nation in a
OL,12,Ftwo-minute silence and lay a wreath at
OL,13,Fthe Cenotaph to remember those who've
OL,14,Fdied - why the memorial is significant
OL,16,FThe Prince of Wales and the Princess
OL,17,FRoyal joined the monarch, with Queen
OL,18,FCamilla and the Princess of Wales
OL,19,Fwatching on from a balcony
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
