OL,3,AThousands of veterans march past
OL,4,ACenotaph on Remembrance Sunday after
OL,5,AKing leads two-minute silence
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, PM Andy Burnham was at the
OL,8,Fservice to pay his respects - as were a
OL,9,Frecord number of former prime
OL,10,Fministers, including Boris Johnson and
OL,11,FTony Blair
OL,13,FAway from London, services are also
OL,14,Ftaking place in communities across the
OL,15,FUK, including in Edinburgh where
OL,16,FScottish FM John Swinney also lay a
OL,17,Fwreath
